Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7603: reset PSE on stuck beacon

---
 ...t76-mt7603-reset-PSE-on-stuck-beacon.patch | 47 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 47 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 patches/openwrt/0014-wifi-mt76-mt7603-reset-PSE-on-stuck-beacon.patch

diff --git a/patches/openwrt/0014-wifi-mt76-mt7603-reset-PSE-on-stuck-beacon.patch b/patches/openwrt/0014-wifi-mt76-mt7603-reset-PSE-on-stuck-beacon.patch
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..5944adff
--- /dev/null
+++ b/patches/openwrt/0014-wifi-mt76-mt7603-reset-PSE-on-stuck-beacon.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,47 @@
+From: David Bauer <mail@david-bauer.net>
+Date: Sun, 8 Feb 2026 00:52:49 +0100
+Subject: wifi: mt76: mt7603: reset PSE on stuck beacon
+
+diff --git a/package/kernel/mt76/patches/351-wifi-mt76-mt7603-reset-PSE-on-stuck-beacon.patch b/package/kernel/mt76/patches/351-wifi-mt76-mt7603-reset-PSE-on-stuck-beacon.patch
+new file mode 100644
+index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..fc00ccfca6af474a2d973ba1fbe8693151a03093
+--- /dev/null
++++ b/package/kernel/mt76/patches/351-wifi-mt76-mt7603-reset-PSE-on-stuck-beacon.patch
+@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@
++From 33f61dde8bb28f412f050d36adf443f4c3969f7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
++From: David Bauer <mail@david-bauer.net>
++Date: Sun, 8 Feb 2026 00:46:11 +0100
++Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7603: reset PSE on stuck beacon
++
++Commit xxx removed the PSE reset on the beacon stuck reset cause.
++
++It is observed in scenarios with many clients on a MT7628 radio, the
++wifi dies with no beacons, no RX and no TX. These errors happen
++consistently, with usually ~3 - 7 days in between.
++
++Manually triggering a reset with the PSE_BUSY reset causes radio to
++become fully responsive again.
++
++Restore the PSE reset when triggering system reset for the beacon stuck
++cause.
++
++Signed-off-by: David Bauer <mail@david-bauer.net>
++---
++ mt7603/mac.c | 1 +
++ 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
++
++diff --git a/mt7603/mac.c b/mt7603/mac.c
++index d3110eeb..098ed64c 100644
++--- a/mt7603/mac.c
+++++ b/mt7603/mac.c
++@@ -1455,6 +1455,7 @@ static void mt7603_mac_watchdog_reset(struct mt7603_dev *dev)
++ 	}
++ 
++ 	if (dev->reset_cause[RESET_CAUSE_RESET_FAILED] ||
+++	    dev->cur_reset_cause == RESET_CAUSE_BEACON_STUCK ||
++ 	    dev->cur_reset_cause == RESET_CAUSE_RX_PSE_BUSY)
++ 		mt7603_pse_reset(dev);
++ 
++-- 
++2.51.0
++
-- 
2.51.0

